<title>USA: Montgomery Ward picks DDB Needham for ads.</title>
<headline>Montgomery Ward picks DDB Needham for ads.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Montgomery Ward &amp; Co Inc, a large, privately held retailer, said Thursday it awarded its $50 million-plus national broadcast media assignment to DDB Needham Chicago, which is part of the Omnicom Group Inc, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the contract, DDB Needham will create all television and radio advertisements for Montgomery Ward's retail business.</p>
</text>
